WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Step into a shorter Warrior II stance.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Front forearm rests on the thigh.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Top arm reaches up or forward.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Keep chest open and belly free.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Inhale up and switch.
